WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.140
[MUSIC PLAYING]

00:00:02.140 --> 00:00:04.370
It just made
sense to us that

00:00:04.370 --> 00:00:07.460
the grandest cinematic
events in Marvel history

00:00:07.460 --> 00:00:11.230
should be executed in full IMAX.

00:00:11.230 --> 00:00:14.190
The level of ambition in
these films is pretty high.

00:00:14.190 --> 00:00:18.450
We needed equipment that could
help us fulfill that ambition.

00:00:18.450 --> 00:00:21.370
As filmmakers, it's an
amazing tool for us-- the way

00:00:21.370 --> 00:00:24.780
that it captures light, the
way that it captures color.

00:00:24.780 --> 00:00:26.200
They're fantastic cameras.

00:00:26.200 --> 00:00:27.470
The chip is incredible.

00:00:27.470 --> 00:00:31.560
It's at a resolution
that is unprecedented.

00:00:31.560 --> 00:00:35.520
The IMAX screen has a different
height than a traditional movie

00:00:35.520 --> 00:00:36.690
screen.

00:00:36.690 --> 00:00:38.640
Having that extra
verticality gives us

00:00:38.640 --> 00:00:41.220
a wider range of
how we frame and how

00:00:41.220 --> 00:00:42.360
we shoot these characters.

00:00:42.360 --> 00:00:45.102
It's just presented on
a much grander scale

00:00:45.102 --> 00:00:46.560
than the traditional
movie theater.

00:00:46.560 --> 00:00:49.910
[MUSIC PLAYING]

